Vastior - NOTICE
================

Vastior is an unofficial community tool for Grim Dawn. It is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Crate Entertainment, Grim Dawn, or Valve / Steam.

Vastior is released under the MIT License (see LICENSE). It is an independent
implementation: it adjusts Grim Dawn's own in-game camera and bundles no
third-party code, binaries, or assets.

Vastior includes its own winmm.dll proxy loader. During install, Vastior creates
winmm_orig.dll from the copy of winmm already present on the user's PC, so no
Microsoft Windows system DLL is redistributed.

